{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>ולא זכר</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and ולא זכר יואש המלך את החסד, and ולא זכר הדום רגליו. The chief cupbearer was ungrateful and did not remember the kindness that Joseph did for him; so too Joash was ungrateful and did not remember the kindness that Jehoiada the priest did for him, and he killed his son Zechariah. And on account of this many souls of Israel were slain, for his blood was fermenting until the Temple was destroyed, and this is: ולא זכר הדום רגליו ביום אפו."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:05.737264956Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}